{{!
    @template local_jedomi/provider_settings_link

    Note and link to the Jedomi settings page in the Datacurso AI provider, shown in the AI service
    card of the General tab of the Jedomi settings.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url string - URL of the Jedomi settings page in the Datacurso AI provider

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/ai/provider/datacurso/admin/plugin_settings.php?component=local_jedomi"
    }
}}
<div class="local_jedomi-provider_settings_link">
    <p class="mb-2">{{#str}} provider_settings_info, local_jedomi {{/str}}</p>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{url}}">{{#str}} provider_settings_link, local_jedomi {{/str}}</a>
</div>
